{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_04F520","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"以女性大脑作为AI模型……是什么意思？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":53,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"Snake，人类精神中有，而计算机没有的东西是什么？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":68,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"……懒惰吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"有趣的回答。也不算错……正确答案是，共情能力。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"共情能力？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"更准确地说，也许应该叫感情移入的能力。疼爱孩子的心、怜惜弱者的心、悼念死者的心……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":126,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"这些都是女性大脑擅长的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"太极端了吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"不，这是结论。另一方面，男性大脑虽然擅长把事物系统化，共情能力却较低。甚至可以说更接近计算机。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":141,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"如果AI的目标是像人类一样思考……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":47,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"那就该学习女性的共情能力，是吗。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"小说《仿生人会梦见电子羊吗？》探讨过这个问题。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"在这部小说里，<R=共情能力,EMPATHY>测试被用来区分机器与人类。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=共情能力,EMPATHY>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"随着计算机发展，今后社会的系统化程度还会进一步加深。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"不能让时代变成这样……街上到处都是缺乏共情、像机器人一样的人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"计算机应该获得共情能力。而人类更应该如此。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"说这种话的你自己呢？我可看不出你对现实中的人有什么共情。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"确实，直到现在我一直被死亡束缚着。我原本打算等Mammal Pod的研究成功后就死。因为除了她以外，我没有活下去的理由。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":160,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"但你改变主意了？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"……是她教会了我生命的可贵。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"今后，我想面对真实的人活下去。我终于能这么想了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"是吗。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""}]}